From 7625ee57ec479fea27f3ba9e03068ec33fc8f2c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aldaeso <kaptureiq@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:20:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add themes, UI languages, technical sheet and redaction

- Themes: 18 visual themes (Oficiais, Fintech, GeoTech) from KaptureBOARD,
  applied through CSS variables; default kapture_sap.
- Languages: pt-BR, en, es, fr, fr-CA, de via i18n.py with a sidebar selector.
  Export files and reader messages stay in Portuguese.
- Technical sheet page in the sidebar, with read-only app information.
- Favorites, tags, front matter, ZIP export with index, incremental export,
  PDF header and logo, and secret redaction before export.
- Sidebar logo; selected conversation scrolls in its own frame.
- LICENSE (MIT), .gitignore, README updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EBgceL5J93Qk9GzRy81xzh
